<p><a name="footnote5"></a><sup>5</sup> D. Filiz Unsal, Chris Papageorgiou,  and Hendre Garbers, 2022. &ldquo;<a href="https://www.elibrary.imf.org/view/journals/001/2022/022/001.2022.issue-022-en.xml">Monetary Policy Frameworks: An Index  and New Evidence</a>,&rdquo; <em>IMF  Working Papers</em> 2022/022 (January).</p>
<p><a name="footnote6"></a><sup>6</sup> Milton Friedman and Anna Jacobson  Schwartz. 2008. <a href="https://press.princeton.edu/books/ebook/9781400829330/a-monetary-history-of-the-united-states-1867-1960-0"><em>A Monetary History of the United  States 1867-1960</em></a> (Princeton: Princeton  University Press).</p>
