<p><a name="footnote8"></a><sup>8</sup> Ben S. Bernanke, <a href="https://www.federalreserve.gov/boarddocs/Speeches/2002/20021108/default.htm">On Milton Friedman&rsquo;s Ninetieth  Birthday</a>, at the  Conference to Honor Milton Friedman, University of Chicago, Chicago, Illinois,  November 8, 2002. </p>
